{"id": "S001", "paragraph": "P001", "zone": "body", "text": "抗生素的广泛使用使耐药菌问题日益严峻，\n开发新型抗菌策略已成为全球公共卫生的重要议题。", "line_start": 5, "line_end": 6, "char_start": 47, "char_end": 90, "cues": [], "needs_support": false}
{"id": "S002", "paragraph": "P001", "zone": "body", "text": "噬菌体作为能够特异性裂解细菌的病毒，\n近年来重新受到学界关注。", "line_start": 7, "line_end": 8, "char_start": 91, "char_end": 122, "cues": [], "needs_support": false}
{"id": "S003", "paragraph": "P001", "zone": "body", "text": "本文围绕耐药菌感染的治疗策略，\n尤其是噬菌体治疗的最新进展进行综述。", "line_start": 9, "line_end": 10, "char_start": 123, "char_end": 157, "cues": [], "needs_support": false}
{"id": "S004", "paragraph": "P002", "zone": "body", "text": "耐药菌感染的治疗负担依然沉重。", "line_start": 12, "line_end": 12, "char_start": 159, "char_end": 174, "cues": [], "needs_support": false}
{"id": "S005", "paragraph": "P002", "zone": "body", "text": "2019 年，一项覆盖 12 个国家的流行病学调查报告，\n耐多药结核病的全球治愈率仅为 57%。", "line_start": 13, "line_end": 14, "char_start": 175, "char_end": 223, "cues": ["number_unit", "year", "report_kw"], "needs_support": true}
{"id": "S006", "paragraph": "P002", "zone": "body", "text": "2023 年发表的另一项荟萃分析则显示，\n短程口服方案可将该指标提升至 82%[2]。", "line_start": 15, "line_end": 16, "char_start": 224, "char_end": 267, "cues": ["number_unit", "year", "report_kw"], "needs_support": true}
{"id": "S007", "paragraph": "P003", "zone": "body", "text": "在噬菌体治疗领域，\n一项早期的随机对照试验纳入了 480 例慢性伤口感染患者，\n比较了噬菌体鸡尾酒疗法与常规换药的效果。", "line_start": 18, "line_end": 20, "char_start": 269, "char_end": 329, "cues": ["number_unit", "report_kw"], "needs_support": true}
{"id": "S008", "paragraph": "P003", "zone": "body", "text": "该试验的随访结果显示，\n两组的伤口完全愈合率无统计学差异，\n但噬菌体组的换药疼痛评分显著更低[3]。", "line_start": 21, "line_end": 23, "char_start": 330, "char_end": 380, "cues": ["report_kw"], "needs_support": true}
{"id": "S009", "paragraph": "P004", "zone": "body", "text": "单一疗法的局限促使研究者转向联合与调控策略。", "line_start": 27, "line_end": 27, "char_start": 401, "char_end": 423, "cues": [], "needs_support": false}
{"id": "S010", "paragraph": "P004", "zone": "body", "text": "已有研究系统梳理了肠道菌群与代谢性炎症\n在耐药感染转归中的作用[4]。", "line_start": 28, "line_end": 29, "char_start": 424, "char_end": 459, "cues": ["report_kw"], "needs_support": true}
{"id": "S011", "paragraph": "P004", "zone": "body", "text": "例如，拟杆菌门与厚壁菌门的比值\n在肥胖合并感染个体中显著降低。", "line_start": 30, "line_end": 31, "char_start": 460, "char_end": 491, "cues": [], "needs_support": false}
{"id": "S012", "paragraph": "P004", "zone": "body", "text": "一项纳入 860 名受试者的横断面研究发现，\n该比值每下降 10%，\n患者的炎症评分平均上升 0.8 分。", "line_start": 32, "line_end": 34, "char_start": 492, "char_end": 545, "cues": ["number_unit", "report_kw"], "needs_support": true}
{"id": "S013", "paragraph": "P004", "zone": "body", "text": "进一步的对照实验显示，\n补充特定益生菌可在 12 周内使该评分下降 15%。", "line_start": 35, "line_end": 36, "char_start": 546, "char_end": 584, "cues": ["number_unit", "report_kw"], "needs_support": true}
{"id": "S014", "paragraph": "P004", "zone": "body", "text": "这些结果提示微生态干预具有潜在的辅助价值。", "line_start": 37, "line_end": 37, "char_start": 585, "char_end": 606, "cues": [], "needs_support": false}
{"id": "S015", "paragraph": "P005", "zone": "caption", "text": "图 1. 益生菌干预对炎症评分的影响（合成示意）。", "line_start": 39, "line_end": 39, "char_start": 608, "char_end": 633, "cues": [], "needs_support": false}
{"id": "S016", "paragraph": "P005", "zone": "caption", "text": "对照实验显示，\n12 周干预可使炎症评分下降 15%[6]。", "line_start": 40, "line_end": 41, "char_start": 634, "char_end": 664, "cues": ["number_unit", "report_kw"], "needs_support": true}
{"id": "S017", "paragraph": "P006", "zone": "body", "text": "噬菌体治疗的临床转化仍面临监管与标准化难题。", "line_start": 45, "line_end": 45, "char_start": 675, "char_end": 697, "cues": [], "needs_support": false}
{"id": "S018", "paragraph": "P006", "zone": "body", "text": "近期一项宏基因组学研究在 1500 份临床分离株中\n鉴定出 4 个新的噬菌体抗性基因家族。", "line_start": 46, "line_end": 47, "char_start": 698, "char_end": 743, "cues": ["number_unit"], "needs_support": true}
{"id": "S019", "paragraph": "P006", "zone": "body", "text": "我们认为，\n这一发现提示未来的噬菌体制剂设计必须将抗性进化纳入考量。", "line_start": 48, "line_end": 49, "char_start": 744, "char_end": 778, "cues": ["opinion"], "needs_support": false}
